<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-GENERALI OPEN MEN'S FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GENERALI OPEN MEN'S FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>KITZBUEHEL, Austria 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final</p>
<p>of the $535,000 Generali Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>10-Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Julian Alonso (Spain) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
